格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DSH 实时 Token 花费与账户余额显示插件（每轮花费 · 总花费 · 余额）","id":"gh:1334837309","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-token-price","slug":"spoon-man569/dsh-token-price","topics":["dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DSH 实时 Token 花费与账户余额显示插件（每轮花费 · 总花费 · 余额）"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-token-price"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**English** | 汉语"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Accurate token-cost and account-balance readouts for the DeepSeek Harness Web chat UI."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## What it shows"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"- **Per-message cost**: the cost for completed request steps in that turn, shown as `¥...` after eac"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"h assistant reply's statistics line on hover.\n- **Session total**: the sum of every reported request"},{"id":"p6s3","text":" step, including a cancelled request that emitted usage but no final assistant message.\n- **Estimate"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"d CNY**: a market-rate USD/CNY conversion shown as `¥...`. USD is not rendered in the UI. This is no"},{"id":"p6s5","text":"t an account debit or official per-request CNY charge.\n- **Account balance**: the official `GET /use"},{"id":"p6s6","text":"r/balance` result. The plugin prefers the returned CNY balance and otherwise preserves the API's ret"},{"id":"p6s7","text":"lt. The plugin prefers the returned CNY balance and otherwise preserves the API's returned currency."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"USD remains the internal accounting value. An unknown provider/model route is shown as **未定价**, neve"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"r as a zero-cost amount."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"One command (requires pnpm):"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"The package declares `dsh.bundle` and `dsh.client`, so this activates both the host service and brow"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"eclares `dsh.bundle` and `dsh.client`, so this activates both the host service and browser readouts."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Configuration"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"`balanceApiKeyEnv` names the credential holding the DeepSeek API key used for the balance request. T"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"he key remains on the host. A failed refresh keeps the last balance sample."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## Pricing and rates"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"`prices.json` is the local, versioned source of official USD rates per million tokens. It is an appe"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"nd-only history: each rule has an `effectiveFrom` timestamp, Beijing peak windows, and explicit pric"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"es for each supported route. New official prices must append a rule; past rules must not be changed."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"The `tokenCost` projection snapshots the request route and time at `request/header`, then calculates"},{"id":"p17s2","text":" each `(turn, step)` from the matching historical USD rule. Replaying the same session log therefore"},{"id":"p17s3","text":" yields the same USD result. The host never scrapes the official price page at runtime."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"USD/CNY is refreshed server-side from public market-rate sources every hour. When that refresh fails"},{"id":"p18s2","text":", the UI uses the current rule's bundled fallback rate. Both values remain estimates (`¥`) and never"},{"id":"p18s3","text":" affect USD accounting."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"`npm test` builds `lib/`, emits type declarations, and runs accounting tests. Restart the DSH Web pr"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"ocess after rebuilding so it loads the new artifacts."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
